sequenceDiagram
  participant D as Developer
  participant E as EAS Update
  participant A as App on device
  D->>E: eas update --channel production
  Note over E: Bundle + assets, runtimeVersion, branch
  A->>E: Launch: check for update (channel + runtimeVersion)
  E-->>A: Manifest of newest compatible update
  A->>E: Download missing assets
  Note over A: Stored, applied on next launch
  A->>A: Launch new bundle, or fall back to embedded one on failure
